trait-self-aware-name = Self-Aware
trait-self-aware-desc = You know your body intimately. When self-examining, you get an exact diagnostic breakdown of your wounds, bleeding, and total damage without needing medical scanners.
self-aware-total-damage = [Self-Diagnosis] Total Damage: {$damage}
self-aware-bleeding = [!] Open arterial bleeding detected!

trait-nyctophobia-name = Nyctophobia
trait-nyctophobia-desc = You are terrified of darkness. Being in unlit environments without a flashlight or light source causes acute anxiety, trembling, and panic.
nyctophobia-darkness-panic = Easy, easy, take it slow... you're in the dark...
nyctophobia-stage-1-unease = The darkness surrounds you... you feel an impending sense of dread.
nyctophobia-stage-2-dread = Your hands tremble uncontrollably from the fear of the dark!
nyctophobia-stage-3-terror = The terror of the shadows suffocates you! You can barely move from despair!
nyctophobia-light-relief = The light brings you calm... you breathe a sigh of relief.

trait-cursed-name = Cursed
trait-cursed-desc = You suffer from unnatural bad luck. Mishaps, sudden stumbles, and dropping items under stress happen to you far more often.
cursed-bad-luck-stumble = You awkwardly stumble over your own feet!

trait-smoker-name = Smoker
trait-smoker-desc = You are dependent on nicotine. If you go too long without smoking, withdrawal coughing and tremors set in. Smoking provides instant calm.
smoker-craving-nicotine = You could really go for a smoke right about now... Your hands tremble slightly.

trait-illiterate-name = Illiterate
trait-illiterate-desc = You never learned how to read or write. Written documents, books, and complex computer interfaces make no sense to you, and you cannot write.
illiterate-cant-write = You don't know how to write!
illiterate-cant-read = The symbols and letters make no sense to you at all...
illiterate-cant-use-console = You stare blankly at the complex text and buttons on the screen without understanding anything... You cannot read!

trait-freerunning-name = Freerunning
trait-freerunning-desc = You are skilled in parkour! You vault over tables, counters, and obstacles with double the speed.

trait-throwing-arm-name = Throwing Arm
trait-throwing-arm-desc = Your arms are exceptionally powerful! Objects you throw travel much faster and further.

trait-skittish-name = Skittish
trait-skittish-desc = You are easily startled! Sprinting into lockers or closets causes you to instinctively jump inside to hide.
skittish-hide-inside = You swiftly hide inside the locker!

trait-spiritual-name = Spiritual
trait-spiritual-desc = You hold deep spiritual faith. Holding holy artifacts or being in sacred chapels brings inner peace and stamina recovery.
spiritual-inner-peace = A feeling of divine serenity washes over you...

trait-depression-name = Depression
trait-depression-desc = You suffer from chronic depression. You periodically experience bouts of apathy, heavy sighing, and reduced stamina.
depression-heavy-sigh = *sighs heavily* Everything feels so utterly meaningless...

trait-family-heirloom-name = Family Heirloom
trait-family-heirloom-desc = You carry an irreplaceable family heirloom. Losing or misplacing it causes deep anxiety.
family-heirloom-name = {$family} Family Heirloom
family-heirloom-desc = A treasured family heirloom of the {$family} family, passed down through generations. Keep it safe!
family-heirloom-missing = A wave of existential dread washes over you as you realize your precious family heirloom is missing... You can't lose it!
family-heirloom-recovered = You retrieve your family heirloom and a deep sigh of relief washes over you.

trait-bad-touch-recoil = Personal space violation! You hate being touched!
bad-touch-toucher-feedback = {$name} visibly flinches and shudders away from the touch, looking thoroughly uncomfortable.
bad-touch-emote = recoils with evident disgust and repulsion from the physical contact.

claustrophobia-panic-stage-1 = You feel the walls closing in on you! Confinement brings acute dread...
claustrophobia-panic-stage-2 = Panic grips you in the tight space! You struggle to catch your breath...
claustrophobia-panic-stage-3 = You feel trapped! Must escape... can't breathe...
claustrophobia-relief = Fresh air fills your lungs! You are no longer trapped.

trait-musician-name = Musician
trait-musician-desc = You understand the beauty of melodies. You spawn with a sealed kit to choose your preferred instrument.
musician-box-title = Choose Musical Instrument
musician-box-prompt = Select the musical instrument you wish to unbox:
musician-box-ok = Confirm
musician-box-cancel = Cancel
musician-unbox-verb = Unbox: {$instrument}
musician-unboxed-msg = You have unboxed your {$instrument}!

trait-photographer-name = Photographer
trait-photographer-desc = You love capturing memorable moments. You spawn with a handheld wireless camera.

trait-colorist-name = Colorist
trait-colorist-desc = You possess an artistic flair. You spawn with a full box of colorful crayons.

trait-bald-name = Bald
trait-bald-desc = Alopecia won't hold you back. You spawn with a stylish fedora hat to cover your scalp.

trait-light-drinker-name = Lightweight Drinker
trait-light-drinker-desc = Your liver processes alcohol very slowly. You get drunk twice as quickly as others.

trait-voracious-name = Voracious
trait-voracious-desc = Nothing gets between you and your food! You devour food and drinks with extreme speed.
trait-voracious-devour = You devour the meal with ferocious speed and appetite!

trait-vegetarian-name = Vegetarian
trait-vegetarian-desc = You follow a strict vegetarian diet. Ingesting meat or animal products causes visceral disgust and nausea.
trait-vegetarian-disgust = You feel immense disgust and nausea having consumed meat!
trait-vegetarian-delight = You enjoy a fresh, healthy, meat-free meal!

trait-no-taste-name = Ageusia (No Taste)
trait-no-taste-desc = You cannot perceive the flavor of food or drinks. Everything tastes bland, allowing you to consume spoiled food without disgust.

trait-pineapple-liker-name = Pineapple Lover
trait-pineapple-liker-desc = You adore pineapples! You find pineapple-topped food and pineapple pizza utterly delightful.
trait-pineapple-liker-delight = The sweet taste of pineapple fills your palate with pure joy!

trait-pineapple-hater-name = Pineapple Hater
trait-pineapple-hater-desc = You detest pineapples with a passion. The idea of fruit on pizza fills you with revulsion.
trait-pineapple-hater-disgust = Disgusting! How can anyone put pineapple on food?!

trait-carnivore-name = Carnivore
trait-carnivore-desc = You follow a strict carnivore diet. Ingesting vegetables, fruits, salads, or plant-based foods causes visceral disgust and nausea.
trait-carnivore-disgust = You feel intense revulsion eating plant matter! Your body demands meat!
trait-carnivore-delight = The rich and hearty taste of meat fills you with energy and satisfaction!
trait-diet-gagging = You gag violently, struggling to hold back vomit!



